        "kind": "playBeat",
        "beats": [
          "Through the glass the clergyman came up close: along his hairline beside the ear, where a careless towel had missed it, a faint brownish line upon the skin, too even to be dirt; and the book was no prayer-book but a thin paper volume in a coloured wrapper, its lines set out in short, uneven lengths that no psalm was ever printed in."
